Note = {International Conference on Healthcare Service Managemen (ICHSM),
   Tsukuba, JAPAN, JUN 08-10, 2018},
Abstract = {The aim of the research was to analyze the effect of brand equity on
   service reutilization interest of inpatient installation of Ibnu Sina
   Hospital in 2015. The research use quantitative approach with cross
   sectional study. The population consisted of 4390 people and the sample
   consisted of 151 people. The data were obtained using logistic
   regression test with p=0.05. The result of the research indicate that
   there is no effect of brand equity variable on the use of service
   reutilization interest of inpatient installation of Ibnu Sina Hospital
   (p=0.319). There is a positive effect of brand association variable on
   service reutilization interest of inpatient installation of Ibnu Sina
   Hospital (p=0.022). There is a positive effect of quality perception
   variable on service reutilization interest of inpatient installation of
   Ibnu Sina Hospital (p=0.002). There is a positive effect of brand
   loyalty variable on service reutilization interest of inpatient
   installation of Ibnu Sina Hospital (p=0.001). Brand loyalty variable has
   the most positive effect on service reutilization interest of inpatient
   installation of Ibnu Sina Hospital, p=0.993 and wald =5.997. In general,
   all variable models can affect service reutilization interest of
   inpatient installation of Ibnu Sina Hospital, which is 93.4\%.},
