Organization = {Malaysia Tech Scientist Assoc},
Abstract = {The concept of quality of life is much wider than the standard of living
   material living condition. It correspondingly includes working
   condition, the degree of social integration, health and education
   whether people are particularly fragile economically or not (Albouy et
   al., 2010). But, the effects of quality of life in every places or city
   may vary in their life pattern. The notion of having an excellent
   quality of life has a much different understanding as Mohit (2013) also
   granted that diverse regions of the world have defined the quality of
   life differently. This paper highlights the factors affecting the
   quality of life by the communities in one of the states in Malaysia
   namely Selangor. In another word, the major contributor of their life to
   be more quality will be assessing. Hence, one of the research question
   for the paper is related to the current level of quality of life among
   the communities in Selangor. The research objectives are to identify the
   major contributor towards the level of quality of life in Selangor and
   to identify the significant between the quality of life of communities
   in Selangor and the elements of quality of life. The expected outcome of
   this paper is to know, which of the several elements in the quality of
   life, does affect the quality of life for the residents in Selangor.},
