Abstract = {Facing with the constantly overloaded operation of the life support
   system on earth currently, the ecological environmental problems become
   more and more serious on a global scale, and the ecological security of
   the geographic space attracts extensive attentions increasingly. Based
   on GIS and spacial ecological condition, this paper builds the
   ecological security evaluation index system, sets up the evaluation
   criterion, designs the space ecological security evaluation model
