   the implementing of `thirty-six-word policy'},
Booktitle = {2011 3RD INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE AND
   INFORMATION APPLICATION TECHNOLOGY ESIAT 2011, VOL 10, PT C},
