Abstract = {The presented study deals with univariate and multivariate analysis of
   the dependencies between the factor and consequent variables in the
   study of the efficiency of a heat pump unit with a radiant evaporator.
   The strength and direction of the connections between these variables is
   studied and discussed. The values of the correlation and determination
   coefficients were determined and the equations of the models describing
   them were derived. The presented analysis is considered as a valuable
   tool for the heating, ventilating and air conditioning design process in
   the building sector.},
